        },
        {
          "text": "Before committing to a shard key, MongoDB’s analyzeShardKey can use sampled queries to report key cardinality, frequency, monotonicity, query targeting, and read/write distribution. MongoDB documents this capability as available starting in version 7.0. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-19)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/sharding-choose-a-shard-key/",
